      "description": "C-130 Mission Computer Replacement Program (MCRP)\n\n•\tDeveloped software for the Mission Computer Replacement program, writing new code in C and modifying legacy code as needed in Ada, enhancing usability and stability of the system.\n\n•\tTested and debugged the code on hardware that had simulated aircraft components communicating with the replacement mission computers over a MIL-STD-1553 bus. \n",
